.TH batten-step-config 1  batten 
.SH NAME
batten\-step\-config \- Print the digests of the config parts a step reads, the step cache\*(Aqs answer to the tool line
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBbatten step config\fR [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] [\fIparts\fR] 
.SH DESCRIPTION
Print the digests of the config parts a step reads, the step cache\*(Aqs answer to the tool line
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.TP
[\fIparts\fR]
The config parts, after `\-\-`: a `config <part> <digest>` line each, every part where none
